Brand watermark versions
title end

paragraph start
A watermark is a low opacity version of the mark placed in a fixed corner. It must stay outside areas covered by platform buttons and must not hide the subject.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Make one watermark per background type, light and dark, and test each over the busiest footage the brand expects.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
version, background type, corner, opacity, tested on
code end

